{"id":"vod_jy_50887","vodId":"50887","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"魔法禁书目录","name_cn":"魔法禁书目录","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/9cf975211038e5cb99138c2dec5786fb.jpg"},"summary":"自己的阳台栏杆上出现了像被单一样挂在上面的少女，这种非现实的情节出现在了上条当麻的眼前。虽然在这个城市——最先进科学引导的学院都市中，超能力已经可以通过科学技术创造出来，但是眼前这位自称“茵蒂克丝”的少女还是把上条当麻吓了一条。茵蒂克丝自称因拥有十万三千本魔导书而被魔法师追杀，而上条当麻靠自己的超能力也认定了少女的魔法。少女以危险为由离开上条家，上条如往日一般去学校学习，但放学回家，却发现茵蒂克丝倒在血泊之中。在科学与魔术交叉的世界中，上条当麻与茵蒂克丝的故事开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-19 16:00:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/oeELgRYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negWqJke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/NbWAEnQe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negWqJGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xboWB2Bb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axW06qe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xboWB2Xb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axW0k3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNorxDe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqWEY0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqWEYGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/ZdPqw7We/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/9av6M8ma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/oeELgq0d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/kazg8vmb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negWqZ3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/mbkWxZEb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https: